WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.467
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show,"
everybody.

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.868
You're here!
Thank you for being here.

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:06.634
Thank you for watching.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:09.767
Thank you. That applause lasted
longer than CNN+.

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:11.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.734 --> 00:00:13.734
That's right.
If you haven't heard, today

00:00:13.734 --> 00:00:16.801
it was announced that
the streaming service CNN+

00:00:16.801 --> 00:00:21.400
is shutting down just 32 days
after it launched.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.634
That's right, CNN+ is gone,
which means in six months,

00:00:24.634 --> 00:00:26.667
it'll be turned into
Spirit Halloween+.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.067
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.067 --> 00:00:31.634
32 days, oh, my --
I've had avocados

00:00:31.634 --> 00:00:33.834
that last longer than that.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.567
Yeah, it was doing so badly,
all they had to do was call

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:37.667
their one subscriber like,

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.033
"Hey, Doug, we're not going to
do this."

00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:44.133
You could tell this was on
the horizon though when CNN

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:46.834
had a CNN countdown clock
to the end of CNN+.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.367
It was very interesting.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:51.200
Well, let's get to some news
or what we think might be news.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.300
Did you guys see this?
Piers Morgan interviewed

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:54.901
former president Trump,

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:57.634
and he released a promo that
shows Trump storming out

00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:00.400
after refusing to admit
that he lost the election.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.634
But now Trump is claiming
he never stormed out

00:01:03.634 --> 00:01:06.701
and that Piers Morgan actually
doctored the footage.

00:01:06.701 --> 00:01:10.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:12.234
In Trump's defense,

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:14.400
I really don't see him
"storming" anywhere.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:19.000
If you haven't seen the clip,
here it is.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.467
-The most explosive interview of
the year.

00:01:21.467 --> 00:01:22.701
-I don't think you're real.

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:25.133
Very dis--
Let's finish up the interview.

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:27.701
-Morgan versus Trump.
-Turn the camera off.

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.334
Very dishonest.

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:35.801
-My only question is has Trump
been living at Mar-A-Lago

00:01:35.801 --> 00:01:37.567
or under a heat lamp
at Golden Corral?

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:39.534
[ Laughter ]
I was wondering.

00:01:39.534 --> 00:01:42.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:42.734 --> 00:01:44.334
I was wondering that.

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:46.100
He's done!
-Nice.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.434
-Flip him over!

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.701
-Texas toast.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.701 --> 00:01:54.501
-Speaking of crazy things on TV,
last night was a new episode of

00:01:54.501 --> 00:01:57.567
"The Masked Singer,"
and the Jack-in-the-box

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:59.968
was revealed to be
Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:01.701
Watch this.

00:02:02.968 --> 00:02:04.467
-Oh, my goodness!

00:02:04.467 --> 00:02:06.767
Former associate
attorney general --

00:02:06.767 --> 00:02:08.000
-Oh, my God.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:13.033
-Former mayor of New York City,
Rudy Giuliani!

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:15.200
-♪ I'm here to tell you, honey ♪

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.567
♪ That I'm bad to the bone ♪

00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:19.801
♪ Bad to the bone ♪

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:23.501
♪ Bad, real bad, very bad ♪

00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:28.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:31.067
-You know, it actually takes
talent not to hit any notes.

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:33.133
I think that's actually --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:35.934
After seeing that, the CDC
reinstated the mask mandate.

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.968
They're like,
"Put the mask back on now.

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.200
Now we're putting the mask
back on."

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:41.734
That's right.

00:02:41.734 --> 00:02:44.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:46.734
"Just put it -- For all of us."

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:49.334
Well, this was nuts.
Last night, the Army --

00:02:49.334 --> 00:02:52.934
the Army dropped parachutists
into the Washington Nationals'

00:02:52.934 --> 00:02:56.400
baseball stadium, but the FAA
forgot to tell the Capitol

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:59.000
it was happening, so they
thought the plane was a threat

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.701
and evacuated the Capitol.

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:02.467
[ Audience laughs, gasps ]

00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:06.100
Come on, you can't sneak up
on the Capitol like that!

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.734
That's like throwing
a surprise party for someone

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:10.033
who just had a heart attack.
It's like, "Hey!"

00:03:10.033 --> 00:03:13.634
Can't do that!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.634 --> 00:03:16.667
Thankfully, everything was fine
until Nancy Pelosi got back

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:18.667
and was like, "Damn it, who
the hell took my podium again?

00:03:18.667 --> 00:03:20.133
Alright, come on now.
It's not funny."

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:23.968
Hey, guys, get this.
Apparently a source close to

00:03:23.968 --> 00:03:27.667
Bernie Sanders said that he
might run for president in 2024

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:30.067
if Joe Biden doesn't.

00:03:30.067 --> 00:03:32.334
So I guess the Democratic ticket
in 2024

00:03:32.334 --> 00:03:34.000
is between the Muppets
in the balcony.

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:39.501
"Statler 2024!"

00:03:43.467 --> 00:03:45.367
Hey, here's some good news.

00:03:45.367 --> 00:03:48.067
Today is Queen Elizabeth's
96th birthday.

00:03:48.067 --> 00:03:50.400
Hey!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.868
Happy birthday.

00:03:52.868 --> 00:03:54.801
And to celebrate,
the royal family posted

00:03:54.801 --> 00:03:56.167
a brand-new photo of her.

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:58.167
This is real.
Take a look at this.

00:03:58.167 --> 00:03:59.734
Yeah.

00:03:59.734 --> 00:04:02.000
Wow, the new "Game of Thrones"
spinoff looks great.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:03.200
I think it's --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.901
Who knows?

00:04:04.901 --> 00:04:06.801
I'm telling you, she's got to
stop feeding the corgis.

00:04:06.801 --> 00:04:09.033
You know what I'm saying?
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.033 --> 00:04:11.200
Looks like she's starring in
a Budweiser commercial.

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:12.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.367 --> 00:04:14.534
That's right,
the Queen turned 96 today,

00:04:14.534 --> 00:04:16.367
and we wanted to wish her
a happy birthday

00:04:16.367 --> 00:04:17.734
the only way we know how.

00:04:17.734 --> 00:04:20.801
So without further ado,
please welcome the wait staff

00:04:20.801 --> 00:04:22.667
from the Times Square
Applebee's.

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:23.968
Come on out, guys.

00:04:23.968 --> 00:04:27.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.133
-♪ Applebee's is fun,
it's true ♪

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.634
-♪ Applebee's is fun,
it's true ♪

00:04:30.634 --> 00:04:31.901
-♪ Especially when we sing
for you ♪

00:04:31.968 --> 00:04:33.434
-♪ Especially when we sing
for you ♪

00:04:33.434 --> 00:04:34.901
-♪ Good news is
we sing for free ♪

00:04:34.968 --> 00:04:36.400
-♪ Good news is
we sing for free ♪

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:37.801
-♪ Bad news is we sing off-key ♪

00:04:37.868 --> 00:04:39.267
-♪ Bad news is we sing off-key ♪

00:04:39.267 --> 00:04:40.701
-♪ Sound off ♪
-♪ Happy ♪

00:04:40.701 --> 00:04:42.100
-♪ Sound off ♪
-♪ Birthday ♪

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:44.567
-♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:04:44.567 --> 00:04:46.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:49.100
-Thank you very much, guys.
Good to see you, everybody.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.968
Thank you for being here.

00:04:50.968 --> 00:04:52.868
That was good. Not bad.

00:04:54.767 --> 00:04:56.300
That's the real --
-Aw, such a thrill.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:58.901
-Times Square Applebee's, go get
their autograph tonight, yeah.

00:04:58.901 --> 00:05:00.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:03.567
Well, people are talking
about this.

00:05:03.567 --> 00:05:07.067
In Florida, a bride and wedding
caterer have been arrested

00:05:07.067 --> 00:05:10.567
for allegedly lacing the lasagna
at her wedding with cannabis.

00:05:10.567 --> 00:05:12.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:12.801 --> 00:05:14.200
Don't clap for that.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.634
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.634 --> 00:05:19.167
People were suspicious after
watching the bride and groom

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:20.901
feed each other
the entire wedding cake.

00:05:20.901 --> 00:05:25.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:25.968 --> 00:05:28.367
That definitely explains why
the father/daughter dance

00:05:28.367 --> 00:05:30.200
was to a four-hour
Grateful Dead bootleg.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.834
[ Laughter ]

00:05:32.834 --> 00:05:35.300
Meanwhile, I heard about a man
in North Carolina who robbed

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:38.634
a dollar store, regretted it,
and then returned all the cash.

00:05:38.634 --> 00:05:40.067
[ Laughter ]

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:41.901
Yeah, apparently the guy looked
around the store and said,

00:05:41.901 --> 00:05:43.901
"You know, I think you guys need
this more than I do."

00:05:43.901 --> 00:05:47.167
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.167 --> 00:05:50.234
And finally, a 21-year-old
Chihuahua has officially claimed

00:05:50.234 --> 00:05:52.834
the title of the world's
oldest dog.

00:05:53.667 --> 00:05:55.634
The dog is so old,
he fetches the tennis ball,

00:05:55.634 --> 00:05:57.467
and then puts it on the bottom
of his walker.

00:05:57.467 --> 00:05:59.467
We have a great show, everybody.

